onsive; moved to WhatsApp at her request; owner wants a visit before price talk; video asked; время сообщим позже<br><b>Price:</b> 15M/mo = 170M/yr, &#x27;masih bisa nego&#x27;<br><b>Pin:</b> no pin yet<br><b>Contact:</b> FB Messenger t/1612793080206999 · she asks to WA +62 817-1731-6111 — KB&#x27;s Facebook (WA from KB&#x27;s own phone if needed)<br><b>Notes:</b> 3BR on the Jimbaran hill; photos being harvested<br><b>Card:</b> <a href="https://baltsat.github.io/bukit-villa-map-assets/deck/#cJ1">all 0 photos + video</a> · video: none yet<br><b>Лайфстайл рядом (фото):</b><br><img src="https://baltsat.github.io/bukit-villa-map-assets/deck/life/eighteight.jpg" width="480"><br><a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=9925454519293096800&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA">Спорт: The Yoga Rescue | Yoga &amp; Sound Healing Bali (3 мин)</a> · <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=7784192513647941219&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA">Пляж: Loloan Coastal Peruvian (10 мин)</a> · <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=13623890251558617223&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA">Кафе: Chill ZONE movie &amp; lounge (3 мин)</a> · <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=10990744897676652213&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA">Ужин: Smoothie Shop (4 мин)</a> · <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=14291536552800870974&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA">Продукты: Pepito Express Puri Gading (4 мин)</a> · <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=9254825273441606556&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA">Отель / бич-клаб: The Leaf Jimbaran (3 мин)</a><br>]]></description><styleUrl>#s1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>115.1443092,-8.8014111,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3BR · FB Messenger · ~250M/yr торг · Bukit Pratama Residence</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Хостинг/тусовка:</b